abstract: >-
  Measurement and analysis code for predicting GEMM and individual layer
  execution times on an NVIDIA RTX 4000 SFF Ada Generation GPU. The release
  includes measurement data, trained models, frozen test results, and
  verification records. Original research data are licensed under CC BY 4.0;
  third-party materials retain their original licenses.
